Package: catboostr
Title: Gradient Boosting on Decision Trees
Version: 1.2.10
Description: Open-source gradient boosting on decision trees with categorical
    features support out of the box. A fork of the upstream CatBoost R package
    packaged for CRAN-style installation; the R API is a strict superset of
    upstream's catboost.* interface.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: caret, testthat, tibble, e1071, Matrix
SystemRequirements: CMake (>= 3.15), C++20, clang and clang++ compiler,
    Python3, Cython, Perl, GNU Make or Ninja
